abstract: "A statistical test, a Python package and browser pages that decide, at a stated error probability, whether a performance target met with an uncertainty threshold under one condition is applicable, not applicable or not determined under another; with the code, recorded results and detector provenance of a case study with PointPillars ensembles on KITTI and nuScenes. Code: MIT; results, configurations and documentation: CC BY-NC-SA 4.0; detector configurations derived from OpenPCDet: Apache 2.0."
